              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಳಾಸ (viḷāsa) — \"address\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಮ್ಮ ವಿಳಾಸ ಏನು? (nimma viḷāsa ēnu?) — \"what is your address?\", built like ನಿಮ್ಮ ಹೆಸರು ಏನು? from the start of the book."
